<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cyprus Amax said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cyprus Amax said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber downgraded Cyprus Amax Minerals Co to attractive from buy, a PaineWebber source said.</p>
<p>-- The source said the firm cut its 1997 share earnings estimate on Cyprus to $1.95 from $2.60.</p>
<p>-- The stock slipped 3/8 to 22.</p>
</text>
